  "reference": "Lät 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lät Pi-tɔr duel Kuɔth kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm läär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu jaak kɛnɛ ji̱ ŋäthä tin te kä Ju-dia jɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ci Jur ruac Kuɔth nhɔk bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Pi-tɔr wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cu ji̱ ŋäthä tin ca cuɛl Pi-tɔr lat jɔ̱ɔ̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wäkɛ i̱, “Ɛŋu wi̱i̱ kä nɛy ti /ka̱n cuɛl ɔ, kä curi wä mi̱th kɛ kɛ kɛɛl?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pi-tɔr ɛ tok kɛ mi lukɛ jɛ kɛ ni tukädɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɣän mëë ta̱a̱ palä rɛy wec kä Yapa, kä cua nyuuth nɛn. Tëëkɛ mi bëë piny ce̱tkɛ bi̱i̱ mi di̱i̱t mi bëë piny nhial, luaykɛ jɛ piny kɛ thukɛ da̱ŋ ŋuan, kä cuɛ ben ni kutdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cä jɛ diel guec, cua ley ti ciök ŋuaani nɛn, ley dɔaar, kɛnɛ muɔɔl piɛny, kɛ diit nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɔw liŋ, jio̱kɛ ɣä i̱, ‘Jiɛc rɔ, Pi-tɔr, näkni kä mi̱thni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cua jɛ loc i̱, ‘/Ciɛ jɛn, Kuäär ni Kuoth kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi jiääk kiɛ mi /ci gɔaa mi cä kɔŋ met cam.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu jɔw ɛ nyɔk kɛ luɔ̱c nhial i̱, ‘Mi ci Kuoth ɛ jak kä mi gɔaa, /cu jɛ cɔl i̱ jiäkɛ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn nɛmɛ cuɛ tuɔɔk ni kä diɔ̱ɔ̱k, kä cuɛ kɛn diaal nyɔk kɛ ti̱c nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ɛn guäth ɛmɔ pa̱ny, cu wutni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k ti ca jäk kä ɣä kä Thɛ-tha-ria cop dueel ëë ta̱kɔ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yiëë ɣä jiök, i̱ bä wä kɛɛl kɛ kɛ a thil gal. Cu dämaari da̱ŋ bäkɛl ti̱ti̱ wä kɛɛl kɛ ɣä bä, kä cua kɔ coth dueel wutdä ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɔ la̱t nën mëë cɛ nɛn ni jääk nhial cuŋä rɛy duëëlɛ, wëë i̱, ‘Jäkni naath kä Yapa, kä ba Thay-mɔn in cɔal i̱ Pi-tɔr wä nööŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bɛ ji̱ ben la̱t ruac in ba kään ni ji̱, yɛnɛ ji̱ ciëŋdu diaal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cä ruac tok, cu Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ ben kä kɛ ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ ben kä kɔn ni tukädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua riet Kua̱r ni Yecu tim, mëë ɛ jɛn i̱, ‘Ci Jɔ̱ɔ̱n naath lak kɛ kɛ pi̱, kä duundɛ ɣöö yɛn ba yɛ lak kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci Kuoth kɛ ka̱m muc mi päär kɛ mucdan, mëë ŋa̱thnɛ Kuäär ni Yecu Kritho. Ku ɣän la ŋa mɔ dëë Kuoth gaŋ ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ mɛmɛ liŋ, cukɛ biɛt ɛ lik. Kä cukɛ Kuoth liak, wäkɛ i̱, “Kä ɛnɔ, ci Kuoth riet nath kɛ rɔ̱ dueeri min naŋ naath teekä ka̱m Jur bä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duel Kuɔth kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu nɛy tëë ca riaw dɔɔr kɛ kui̱ ciaaŋ jiääk mëë ci tuɔɔk kɛ näk Thi-bɛn wä a räth nikä Po-ni-cia, Ki-ti-yim, kɛnɛ Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk, thilɛ ram mi cua la̱t ruac Yecu ɛ ni ji̱ Juudh kärɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ wutni ti bä kä Ki-ti-yim, kɛnɛ Thay-rin, wä kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk, cukɛ ruac la̱t Jur bä, latkɛ thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ Kua̱r ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buɔ̱m Kua̱r ni Kuoth tekɛ kɛ kɛɛl, kä cu nɛy ti ŋuan ŋa̱th kä cua rɔ̱ riet Kuäär ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu thuk ɛ ti räth dueel Kuɔth kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cukɛ Bar-na-bäth jäkä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ ben kä nɛnɛ puɔ̱th baaŋ Kuɔth, cu lɔcdɛ tɛɛth, kä cuɛ kɛn diaal com kɛ ɣöö bikɛ te kɛ ŋa̱th kɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth kɛ lo̱ckiɛn kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bar-na-bäth ɛ wut mi gɔaa mi ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ kɛnɛ ŋa̱th. Kä cua nɛy ti ŋuan nöŋ Kuäär ni Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bar-na-bäth wä Tar-thäth wëë Thɔɔl go̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä mëë cɛ jɛ jek, cuɛ jɛ nööŋ kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk. Kɛ ruɔ̱n kɛɛliw cukɛ mat kɛ duel Kuɔth, kä cukɛ nɛy ti nyin ŋuan ŋi̱eec. Kä cua ji̱ kɔaar Yecu cɔl kɛ nhiam i̱ “Krith-cini” kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu göök jiɛɛn kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wäkɛ kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ram kɛl kä kɛ mi cɔal i̱ A-ga-buth rɔ jiɛc, kä cuɛ jɛ mar kɛ Yiëë, ɛn ɣöö bi ɣɔw kɛɛliw tekɛ buɔth mi di̱i̱t. Kä cu mɛmɛ tuɔɔk kɛ ni̱n rui̱cä Ki-lɔ-diäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
